## 🚀 Projects

### 🔬 [Malware Analysis Lab](https://github.com/kodurusairam/Malware-Analysis)
> Static & dynamic malware analysis of **XWorm, AsyncRAT, and AgentTesla** in isolated Windows 10 VM

- Extracted IOCs — file hashes, C2 IPs, mutex values, dropped files, registry persistence keys
- PE structure analysis, string extraction, behavioral analysis using PEStudio, Procmon, Regshot, ANY.RUN
- Documented analyst-style investigation reports with IOC tables and MITRE ATT&CK mappings

### ⚙️ [Tines SOAR — URL Analysis Automation](https://github.com/kodurusairam/tines-url-analysis-automation)
> Automated URL triage workflow using **Tines + URLScan.io API**

- Domain extraction, known-good conditional bypass, private URLScan submission
- Async result retrieval, screenshot capture, enriched investigation output
- Conditional branching and error handling replicating real SOC analyst decision logic

